erate combined 2d (10s in) â€” still in the middle of the interesting part./NPC proportion pass so gear has a place to sit.*Still on garment sculpt â€” the slow step.!Putting a rig on the source body.>Hanging in on generate combined 2d; this pass is running long./Massing an NPC torso that can hold accessories.Tidying clothing topology.#Still placing joints on the source.*A one-piece preview mesh for this garment..Putting the garment on the body for a preview./Evening this NPC before clothes and gear go on.LStill on rig source body (21s in) â€” hanging in â€” good work doesn't rush.!Folds and hems should read in 3D.9Hanging in on rig source body; this pass is running long.^Still on mesh generation composite:bottoms (21s in) â€” hanging in â€” good work doesn't rush.gStill on mesh generation composite:head accessories (21s in) â€” hanging in â€” good work doesn't rush.\Still on mesh generation composite:shoes (21s in) â€” hanging in â€” good work doesn't rush.[Still on mesh generation composite:tops (21s in) â€” hanging in â€” good work doesn't rush.+The silhouette should agree with the sheet.THanging in on mesh generation composite:head accessories; this pass is running long.IHanging in on mesh generation composite:shoes; this pass is running long.6Are the legs and arms the length the drawing promised?JHanging in on mesh generation clothing:bottoms; this pass is running long.KHanging in on mesh generation composite:bottoms; this pass is running long.HHanging in on mesh generation composite:tops; this pass is running long.showPreviewMatching body to clothing.Drawing a one-piece preview.KStill on mesh generation composite:head accessories after the typical wait.0NPC head and neck â€” hats need a place to land.AStill on mesh generation clothing:bottoms after the typical wait.BStill on mesh generation composite:bottoms after the typical wait.?Still on mesh generation composite:tops after the typical wait.&A fit nudge so clothing doesn't float.@Hanging in on render on