teresting part.Bind-pose check.9Hanging in on fit parts:shoes; this pass is running long.[Still on fit parts:head accessories (40s in) â€” checking that the form is landing cleanly.FHanging in on segment propagate 3d:bottoms; this pass is running long.0Cleaning intersections between clothes and body.HStill on align body:bottoms (55s in) â€” another pass before we move on.=Still on segment propagate 3d:bottoms after the typical wait.$Still pulling overlapping geo apart.GStill working through segment propagate 3d:bottoms â€” it's a long one.?Hanging in on render one piece:tops; this pass is running long.VStill on intersection fixing:shoes (24s in) â€” hanging in â€” good work doesn't rush.#Getting meshes ready for autosetup.WStill on segment 3d seed:tops (12s in) â€” still in the middle of the interesting part.aStill on intersection fixing:head accessories (24s in) â€” hanging in â€” good work doesn't rush.WStill on prep autosetup:shoes (12s in) â€” still in the middle of the interesting part.>Hanging in on segment 3d seed:tops; this pass is running long.>Hanging in on prep autosetup:shoes; this pass is running long.bStill on prep autosetup:head accessories (12s in) â€” still in the middle of the interesting part.EStill on align body:tops (55s in) â€” another pass before we move on.CHanging in on segment propagate 3d:tops; this pass is running long.RStill on fit parts:bottoms (40s in) â€” checking that the form is landing cleanly.9Hanging in on align body:tops; this pass is running long.OStill on fit parts:tops (40s in) â€” checking that the form is landing cleanly.XStill on intersection fixing:bottoms (24s in) â€” hanging in â€” good work doesn't rush.YStill on prep autosetup:bottoms (12s in) â€” still in the middle of the interesting part.UStill on intersection fixing:tops (24s in) â€” hanging in â€” good work doesn't rush.BHanging in on intersection fixing:tops; this pass is running long.VStill on prep autosetup:tops (12s in) â€” still in the middle of the interes